resca e riposata (prima della sveglia!).&nbsp;</span><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; font-weight: 400;">È la qualità del sonno che avevamo da adolescenti sani. (Ho 38 anni.)</span></p><p></p><p></p></div></div><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1716926952062" class="gf_row gf_equal-height gf_row-gap-0" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1716926952062" data-layout-lg="6+6" data-extraclass="" data-layout-md="6+6" data-layout-sm="6+6" data-layout-xs="6+6" data-row-gap="0px" style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; visibility: visible;"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-6" id="c-1647320350708" data-id="1647320350708" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: auto;"><div data-label="Icon List Hoz" data-key="icon-list-hoz" data-atomgroup="module" id="m-1716926952059" class="module-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-iconlist2" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1716926952059"><div class="module gf_module-left gf_module-left-lg gf_module--md gf_module--sm gf_module--xs "><ul class="gf_icon-list"><li class="item" style="width: 14px;"><div data-index="1" data-key="content" class="item-content"><div data-label="Icon" id="e-1716926952059-1" class="element-wrap" data-icon="eicon-post" data-id="1716926952059-1"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf-elm-right-lg gf-elm-right-md gf-elm-right-sm gf-elm-right-xs" data-exc=""><div class="gf_icon-wrap" style="color: rgb(250, 173, 20);"><i class="gf_icon fa fa-star"></i></div></div></div></div></li><li class="item" style="width: 14px;"><div data-index="2" data-key="content" class="item-content"><div data-label="Icon" id="e-1716926952118" class="element-wrap" data-icon="eicon-post" data-id="1716926952118"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf-elm-right-lg gf-elm-right-md gf-elm-right-sm gf-elm-right-xs" data-exc=""><div class="gf_icon-wrap" style="color: rgb(250, 173, 20);"><i class="gf_icon 